<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. brown said it cut its rating on Scholastic Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 4-3/4 at 68.</p>
